  "detail_url": "https://api.sam.gov/prod/opportunities/v1/noticedesc?noticeid=30d76da90ab04e4e94b367fd4a2dc3d4",
  "detail_text": "The United States Army Band (TUSAB), traditionally known as \"Pershing’s Own,\" is the official Army Band of the North Capitol Region-Military Department of Washington. As such, TUSAB is the Army's official musical ceremonial unit and escort to the President as well as members of Congress and the Pentagon. The ceremonial band element of TUSAB is also the official musical escort for all Army funerals at Arlington National Cemetery. The band's distinctive uniform, a key part of its public image, is steeped in tradition and requires adherence to strict quality and appearance standards. Distinctive caps are needed for the U.S. Army Band in accordance with the technical specifications detailed in purchase description.",
